  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: cbdfddbb1a7e9dedeeccda6985376314, type: 3}
  m_Name:
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  itemId: 219
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: 正当你以为林沐心是在为自己失败的厨艺而失落，打算出言安慰她时，没说出口的话却被打断了。
