  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: cbdfddbb1a7e9dedeeccda6985376314, type: 3}
  m_Name:
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  itemId: 260
  indentLevel: 1
  storyText: 直到手头的食材全都被消耗完毕，林沐心又缠着让你传授了一番控火之法后，方才迎着朝霞分别离去。
  description:
  AvatarIDSetType: 1
  AvatarID: {fileID: 0}
  AvatarIntID: 1
